// **A form probe, not a shipped species** (WP-C, `Reports/plant-
// implementation-plan.md`). One question: is a *weeping* habit -- a willow's
// hanging curtain, a form class no shipped species occupies -- already
// reachable with no code at all?
//
// **This file is tree.ron with one line changed.** Every other value is
// copied verbatim, deliberately: it is the strictest form of the paired
// comparison this repo insists on, so whatever the sheet shows is that one
// line and nothing else. The line:
//
//     tree.ron   upward_weight: [0.9,  0.35,  0.1,   0.05]
//     here       upward_weight: [0.9, -0.45, -0.65, -0.75]
//
// Order 0 keeps tree's +0.9 -- the trunk still has to stand the plant up,
// and a weeping willow's leader does climb. Orders 1+ go *negative*, which
// inverts what the tier reference buys: `dot(dir, (0,-1)) * upward_weight`
// (plant.rs, the Grow scorer) is a plain multiply against a fixed "up"
// reference, so a negative weight scores downward steps positively and the
// laterals hang.
//
// **Verified before authoring, because the plan asked whether the range was
// clamped: it is not.** There is no `.max(0.0)` or clamp on `upward_weight`
// anywhere in `src/sim` -- a shoot reads `upward_weight.at(order)` raw with
// no genotype multiplier on it, and the one `.max(0.0)` in plant.rs guards
// the genotype *multiplier*, not the weight. So negatives were always
// expressible and no widening was needed; the corner had simply never been
// authored. `organism.rs`'s own field doc already contemplated the sign
// ("a root's default gravitropism ... i.e. negative `upward_weight`").
//
// Judged against the four-axes bar in `Reports/plant-evolution-design.md`
// §4a. A verdict of "another small tree" is a deliverable.
(
    name: "weeping",
    foliage_bands: (first: 2, count: 2),
    bark_bands: (first: 0, count: 2),
    stomatal_reserve: 0.2,
    cell_types: [
        (Seed, [
            Germinate(
                light_threshold: 0.1,
                moisture_threshold: 0.0,
                instant: false,
            ),
        ]),
        (GrowingTip, [
            Grow(
                cost: 0.2,
                branch_chance: [0.03, 0.12, 0.2, 0.25],
                continuation_weight: 0.7,
                light_weight: [0.15, 0.3, 0.5, 0.6],
                wind_weight: 0.2,
                // THE ONE CHANGED LINE. See the header.
                upward_weight: [0.9, -0.45, -0.65, -0.75],
                crowding_weight: 30.0,
                max_active_tips: 14,
                plastochron: [12, 5, 2, 2],
                penetration_force: 0.0,
                turgor_taper: 0.3,
                heading_inertia: 0.85,
                branch_angle: [70.0, 60.0, 50.0, 45.0],
                internode: [0, 6, 4, 3],
                leaf_cluster: 10,
                juvenile_size: 60,
                juvenile_plastochron: 0.25,
                juvenile_branch: 1.5,
                genotype_variance: (0.5, 0.0, 0.4, 0.18, 0.7, 0.0, 0.4, 0.5, 0.0),
                turgor_source: 1.0,
                turgor_yield: 0.1,
                turgor_per_cell: 0.0075,
                sympodial: [false],
                tropism: [Orthotropic],
            ),
            Photosynthesize(rate: 0.5, shade_death: 0.0, transpiration: 0.05, drought_death: 0.0),
        ]),
        (RootTip, [
            Absorb(rate: 1.5),
            Grow(
                cost: 0.25,
                branch_chance: [0.04],
                continuation_weight: 0.7,
                light_weight: [0.0],
                wind_weight: 0.0,
                upward_weight: [0.6],
                crowding_weight: 0.0,
                max_active_tips: 10,
                plastochron: [0],
                heading_inertia: 0.75,
                penetration_force: 1.2,
                genotype_variance: (0.0, 0.5, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.4, 0.0, 0.0, 0.25),
            ),
        ]),
        (MatureBody, [
            Reproduce(seed_cost: 0.3, seed_chance: 4e-05, seed_maturity: 600),
            SecondaryThicken(pipe_ratio: 5.5),
            StructuralAnchor,
            Absorb(rate: 1.5),
        ]),
        (DormantBud, [
            BudBreak(
                cost: 0.2,
                thickening_survival: 0.2,
            ),
            StructuralAnchor,
            SecondaryThicken(pipe_ratio: 5.5),
        ]),
        (Leaf, [
            Photosynthesize(
                rate: 0.35,
                shade_death: 0.003,
                transpiration: 0.05,
                drought_death: 0.003,
            ),
        ]),
    ],
)
